Pretendard 1.3.9 Regular — TARS 툴킷의 비례폭 글꼴(TK design 결정 6, TK-M0 plan 확정 4).

출처      https://github.com/orioncactus/pretendard/releases/download/v1.3.9/Pretendard-1.3.9.zip
          안의 public/static/Pretendard-Regular.otf(1,574,352 B)와 LICENSE.txt
